{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "99c0aae313c548aa4d5ac8b6938f7f6078f26b850696aa69a1ce4f66c785a1a3", "ja": "魅裏怨 -いっしょ-", "zh": "魅里怨──一起", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4ec75824227d9ced24aaac89cc0b1cfa862277192a56264ce2ab3329cd30d302", "ja": "美奈子を探す可奈の前に瑞希が現れ、ぷっぷ\nかさんに関する情報を語る。その日の夜、可\n奈は美奈子にもらった和三盆入りのプチシュ\nーを食べながら、美奈子は枕元に和三盆を置\nいていないのでは？　と気付くのだった。", "zh": "瑞希出现在正在寻找美奈子的可奈面前，\n向她提供了关于噗、噗卡小姐的情报。\n当天晚上可奈吃着美奈子送的和三盆小泡芙，\n突然惊觉美奈子之前可能没在枕边放和三盆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1000_036kan", "source_sha256": "4522a8a69000690e31621f5c848cc07143aa4178983d4c448a548b9f03c437f3", "ja": "はぁ……。今日の練習、全然ダメダメだったな～。", "zh": "唉……今天的练习完全不行啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "1be6dd01d0c3cb881b8ac3417e7f51b958a779b65e432ed48a4887f027e38120", "ja": "美奈子さん、もう帰っちゃったかな……。\n美奈子さーん？", "zh": "不知道美奈子她是不是已经回去了……\n美奈子──？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "f83fda40befbeb9a5f8ec1b449734266da2e541a428cbffb7e060c51b7db08a8", "ja": "瑞希です。矢吹可奈さん。", "zh": "我是瑞希，矢吹可奈同学。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "5e8150d80322a70d96176ff4bf5424fdf75692ce4d1f5d1ca01d395bbe26e420", "ja": "ひゃあああっ！？\nあ、お、オカルト部の部長さん？", "zh": "呀啊啊啊！？\n啊，超、超自然研究社的社长？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "094f383c9fa7bfcaa8a61b54c5005cf63eaa51ac848189a15d36ecff30929589", "ja": "佐竹さんをお探しですか。\n昨日も一緒でしたし、仲がいいんですね。", "zh": "你在找佐竹同学吗？\n你们昨天也在一起，感情很要好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "e11f56adb7a3506ddb327d980a39ab4621e63c3dd687cffba2d21028e91abc1b", "ja": "はい！　美奈子さんは、幼馴染なんです！　毎日一緒に\n登校してるし、昨日もここで、ぷっぷかさんを……。", "zh": "没错！我跟美奈子是从小一起长大的朋友！\n每天会一起上学，昨天也在这里召唤了噗、噗卡小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "951a5ad09ce04d9db9301ba45d252e0cf5f546cf16534fedccdfd8e34c27e4a1", "ja": "あの……ぷっぷかさんって、当たるんですか？", "zh": "那个……噗、噗卡小姐说的话准吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "27ecd077894c2c1c5661e4b77401ea27be962a7f3eb9e2953f63021d67fe67f5", "ja": "ぷっぷかさんを行った生徒が知らないようなことまで、\nなぜか知っている、ということはあるようです。", "zh": "听说噗、噗卡小姐甚至知道\n连召唤她的学生都不清楚的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "f16fd06b6923923df5b9c431518d741683f629cbb52e502553252ce1d93f8f5b", "ja": "……例えば、他人のテストの点とか。ですが、\nこれから起こることを予測することはできません。", "zh": "……例如说其他人的考试分数之类的。\n但是，噗、噗卡小姐无法预测将来会发生的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "a65cf041d0924db327865deb497df6d0badb3d41cf401023670591785d5a5ed7", "ja": "そうなんですか……私が歌手になれるって\n言ってくれたのに、ちょっと残念だな。", "zh": "这样啊……亏她还说我能够成为歌手呢，\n感觉有点遗憾呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "5cb4dac3c5e52c8aff5ad151c62160c72347aeeb1918daa63446037274e1ed7d", "ja": "歌手になれるかどうかを聞いたんですか？", "zh": "你向她询问自己能不能成为歌手吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "dbc55db68a0f46d8dbdee2ca11af49aabc8220d2ec23daca424b5d87ef2a5f25", "ja": "はい。私、歌がだーいすきなんです！　嬉しくても、\n悲しくても、ららら～ってすぐに歌い出しちゃう～♪", "zh": "是啊，我最～喜欢唱歌了！不管是开心还是悲伤，\n都会马上「啦啦啦～」地唱出声来～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "e352cc66bb32b689c8ef7a1b50f7cdedd3b413d220d7912ba91c42b6c95d941b", "ja": "でも……私の歌を好きって言ってくれるのは、\n美奈子さんだけなんです。", "zh": "不过……说过喜欢我唱的歌的人，\n就只有美奈子而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "101f9e7ce46ac3dd4fdb1b8693586dc7f8e7dee5a299d2b953ec6a5cc89e6657", "ja": "私の夢を、ずっと応援してくれてて……\nそれで、ぷっぷかさんにも聞いてくれたんです。", "zh": "她一直在为我的梦想加油打气……\n所以她也为我问了噗、噗卡小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "3a3f14f01f931a4e651ba7ff1aa8cfd6ef81d2966469f2128117fe32bf0f4dbf", "ja": "美しい友情……。\n……少し、うらやましい。", "zh": "真是美好的友情……让人有点羡慕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "cdb5bc3ac90771c711edcb48074f062f87c1163188f84e39aee72dc677c6888b", "ja": "でも美奈子さん、今朝はちょっとおかしかったな～。\n用事があるって先に学校行っちゃうし……。", "zh": "但是美奈子早上有点怪怪的说～\n说是有事所以就先去学校了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "ff13a13a86220158f73ab8f873103d2ce038b9f2351381e917c9155edc63d808", "ja": "おかしかった？　……矢吹さん。\n昨日は、枕元にちゃんと和三盆を置きましたか？", "zh": "有些奇怪？矢吹同学……\n你昨天有确实把和三盆放在枕边吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "5b3e2d6067c6a764d5db42dcf1ed1804d2ed20caa6b0d64c584d5c60c9d14d7b", "ja": "置きました！　美奈子さんも……たぶん。\n一緒にお砂糖、買いましたし。", "zh": "有啊！美奈子她……应该也有吧。\n毕竟我们是一起买了砂糖。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "7b9d6068ad7d14373a4d0f2d126d278799b32f7726d435d2c82ebf25cd306ceb", "ja": "ならば、問題なし。……そのはずです。", "zh": "那么就没问题了……应该没问题才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "8df9e8b2e70aebbd2a892014e4630f4f55f5636b70c0749f0bb69fe713c60cb4", "ja": "和三盆、なめてみたら甘くておいしかった～。\nけど、なんで和三盆なんですか？", "zh": "我舔了和三盆以后觉得好甜好好吃喔～\n不过为什么是和三盆呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "c5b5ee58b0eec9f67a60f218ccf3a9754dcbc1c3bdc82c38d99354b49630cdc3", "ja": "わかりません。ただ、歌が聞こえるのです。\n……さんぼ、わさんぼ、和三盆～♪", "zh": "我也不晓得。只不过似乎是因为会听到歌声。\n……一盆、两盆、和三盆～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "f49e16819b922f2731d23e724823d3f96c342a7c95f742a52587a00b5e07f3e0", "ja": "ぷっぷかさんを行った生徒は、\nよくこの歌を聞いているようです。", "zh": "召唤了噗、噗卡小姐的学生，\n好像常常会听到这首歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "14ff2aaa0503aefe4db5d48ad6fe3c5d1ee3eb90d25faab1d84e2db94792df0d", "ja": "ふーん。なんだか個性的な歌ですね。", "zh": "哦～感觉还真是首很有特色的歌呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "6f7136ced66f40e07380472e598fd09221d13755b41d9a2a16d168794466910c", "ja": "……和三盆。ぷっぷかさんの好物なのかもしれません。", "zh": "和三盆……那说不定是噗、噗卡小姐喜欢的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "0152ca83c26b2ae4ffe4341968c78879ef9c1c060fab5526c26a422eaac29f49", "ja": "さんぼ、わさんぼ、和三盆～♪\nさぼてんさんは針千本～♪　ぼんぼぼ～ん♪", "zh": "一盆、两盆、和三盆～♪\n仙人掌先生千根针～♪针针针～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1025_036kan", "source_sha256": "024052851efa767d4e3a5999d0055979d27f29a6c5c2c373d0159cad8d8527f3", "ja": "えへ♪　寝る前だけど、ちょっとお腹すいちゃった。\n美奈子さんにもらったプチシュー、食べよー♪", "zh": "嘿嘿♪虽然等一下要睡了，但肚子有点饿呢。\n来吃美奈子给我的小泡芙吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1026_036kan", "source_sha256": "4c2a2d17f9b1ae75451fe9d28e9f16302859e40c1cd9d8b87fc190afbda46a46", "ja": "ん～、デリシャス～♪　いつもよりカスタードの甘さが\nすっきりしてて、高級なプチシューって感じっス～♪", "zh": "嗯～美味～♪卡士达奶油的甜度比以往还更不腻，\n感觉就像是高级小泡芙呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "78c18397325cf093cc2262bf7dc9e9a4de7d18b84646481fb76df1d944678a95", "ja": "ん……？　すっきりした甘さの……高級な……。\nこれって、和三盆入りのカスタードクリーム？", "zh": "嗯……？甜而不腻……高级……\n这该不会是加了和三盆的卡士达奶油？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1029_044miz", "source_sha256": "fe2c609025f1acc5571760a2e54f2acbadb2a92e4e1283dc45b62c9bba4800ab", "ja": "昨日は、枕元にちゃんと和三盆を置きましたか？", "zh": "你昨天有确实把和三盆放在枕边吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_03_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "87a61b663828640b7e0645a6ae2f5bf81369b19c05b22290edfbd5cb4d76fe3e", "ja": "美奈子さん、もしかして……。", "zh": "美奈子她该不会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
